    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it's just frustrating because it feels like there's something \"wrong\" or \"sabotaging\" the airflow in that one spot. are there any other weird or less obvious stuff that could be causing this? like something that wouldn't show up on a standard inspection?",
